{{Term/Store|Ironshell Crab|Ironshell Crabs|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s and [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Ironshell Crab}}
Ironshell Crabs can be found near [[Water (Terrain)|Water]], usually along beaches in [[Necluda]]. They can often be seen walking along the [[Sand]] or in [[Shallow Water]], or hiding under [[Rock]]s. When approached, they will scurry away, but usually are not very fast and can be caught easily. Eating one raw will restore one [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. They can also be roasted by a [[Fire]] to become [[Blackened Crab]]s or chilled by [[Ice]] to become [[Frozen Crab]]s. [[Cooking]] a [[Meal]] with Ironshell Crabs will grant Link [[Defense Up]].

